\begin{notation}
\label{not:2-8-extra-3}



For a smooth manifold $M$, write $C^\infty(M)$ for the real-valued smooth
functions on $M$; with pointwise operations it is a commutative associative
$\mathbb R$-algebra.
\end{notation}

